OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear and
OL,6,Fdry to start the night. Clouding over
OL,7,Flater, with light rain across western
OL,8,Fparts by Monday morning. The wind
OL,9,Fgradually eases to a gentle breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FRain soon moves in to affect
OL,12,Fmost parts by late morning. Becoming
OL,13,Fdry but remaining cloudy later in the
OL,14,Fafternoon as the rain clears. Turning
OL,15,Fbreezy, especially along coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
