OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fwith rain and showers Tuesday morning,
OL,7,Fclearing later. Mostly dry on
OL,8,FWednesday, with the wind easing during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Foggy Thursday morning,
OL,10,Fwith brighter conditions later and
OL,11,Flighter winds.
